WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 10

01:42.540 --> 01:44.220
"It's the Investigator's Office that

01:44.220 --> 01:47.200
asked Teng Zijing to pretend to be killed.

01:47.540 --> 01:48.860
I knew that,

01:48.860 --> 01:50.600
so it's not an offense.

01:50.820 --> 01:54.710
=Eunuch Hou, private servant of Emperor Qing=
It's the Imperial Magistrate's duty to try a case.

01:54.730 --> 01:57.800
The members of the royal family should go back

01:57.820 --> 01:59.430
and mind your own business."

01:59.450 --> 02:01.810
Your subject obeys.

02:10.290 --> 02:11.730
Your Highness.

02:16.370 --> 02:17.970
May I

02:18.010 --> 02:19.160
take the liberty

02:19.180 --> 02:21.120
to ask you a question?

02:21.620 --> 02:22.760
Speak.

02:23.570 --> 02:26.920
Do you know that

02:27.450 --> 02:30.690
I was assassinated in Danzhou not long ago?

02:56.140 --> 02:57.120
Your Excellency.

02:57.140 --> 02:58.250
Here I am.

02:58.290 --> 03:00.560
His Majesty ordered you to meet him in the palace.

03:02.620 --> 03:04.990
Now... now?

03:05.010 --> 03:07.710
Well, are you not available?

03:07.730 --> 03:10.040
No no no. I don't dare.

03:10.620 --> 03:12.920
I will obey the order.

03:13.060 --> 03:14.810
Then follow me.

03:15.180 --> 03:16.400
As you wish.

03:17.730 --> 03:19.690
Please wait, Eunuch Hou.

03:21.010 --> 03:22.760
Do you have something to say?

03:23.450 --> 03:25.280
What about us?

03:26.650 --> 03:28.900
The judge has already left.

03:28.900 --> 03:30.780
Now you should go back home

03:30.780 --> 03:32.920
and mind your own business.

03:33.140 --> 03:34.830
The capital city is not big,

03:34.850 --> 03:37.250
we will meet some day.

04:01.700 --> 04:03.170
Please rise.

04:05.930 --> 04:07.370
I'll take you back.

04:08.850 --> 04:11.040
Mr. Fan, you have a promising future,

04:11.370 --> 04:13.090
I don't dare to destroy it.

04:14.450 --> 04:17.810
Let's gather at the Joy Tsin House the other day.

04:37.330 --> 04:39.290
Who on earth are you?

04:41.140 --> 04:42.720
I won't ask you about your background.

04:43.020 --> 04:44.850
Then I won't tell anyone

04:45.170 --> 04:47.010
you once went out.

04:47.460 --> 04:48.920
All I remember is

04:51.050 --> 04:53.600
one night with you on my bed.

05:17.610 --> 05:19.040
Let's go out first.

05:29.420 --> 05:30.690
Sir.

05:30.930 --> 05:32.250
I can't help it.

05:32.740 --> 05:34.040
The case

05:35.090 --> 05:36.720
is closed.

05:42.280 --> 05:44.470
=Prefecture of Capital City=

05:45.050 --> 05:47.310
Did the Investigator's Office ask you to play dead?

05:47.330 --> 05:48.590
Of course not.

05:48.610 --> 05:49.260
Then why did His Majesty

05:49.260 --> 05:50.760
give the order?

05:51.210 --> 05:53.250
I have no idea.

05:54.860 --> 05:57.760
Could it be that His Majesty appreciates you

05:58.210 --> 05:59.630
and wants to get you out of the trouble?

05:59.650 --> 06:01.300
I have been here for just a few days

06:01.300 --> 06:03.020
and I haven't even seen His Majesty.

06:03.020 --> 06:04.170
What does he appreciate me for?

06:04.170 --> 06:05.810
It's so weird.

06:07.740 --> 06:08.420
Anyway,

06:08.420 --> 06:10.250
you come back to life again

06:10.420 --> 06:11.770
and can show up in public

06:11.770 --> 06:13.280
from today on.

06:13.300 --> 06:14.530
What's your plan?

06:15.580 --> 06:16.520
That's true.

06:16.540 --> 06:17.590
Don't talk about me.

06:17.610 --> 06:18.840
Go back home now and let your families know you are safe.

06:18.860 --> 06:20.000
If you have time,

06:20.020 --> 06:21.190
welcome to my house.

06:21.210 --> 06:22.120
Alright.

06:22.140 --> 06:23.480
Fan Xian.

06:24.260 --> 06:25.570
Fan Xian.

06:27.420 --> 06:28.760
I will be waiting for you at home.

06:35.770 --> 06:37.000
What's wrong?

06:37.020 --> 06:39.160
I heard that His Majesty sent people here.

06:40.370 --> 06:42.200
It matches you well.

06:44.890 --> 06:46.090
Am I impressive?

06:56.980 --> 06:58.190
Boss.

06:58.210 --> 07:00.120
Has Young Master Guo come here today?

07:00.140 --> 07:01.720
You don't know that?

07:01.820 --> 07:03.330
I heard that Young Master Guo

07:03.330 --> 07:04.460
was beaten last night

07:04.460 --> 07:06.170
and severely injured.

07:06.170 --> 07:08.320
Guo Baokun was beaten?

07:08.930 --> 07:10.680
What about his servant?

07:10.700 --> 07:11.520
Was he injured?

07:11.540 --> 07:12.610
Young Master Guo only takes hatchet men with him

07:12.610 --> 07:14.210
when he goes out.

07:14.210 --> 07:15.910
He never takes a servant with him.

07:15.930 --> 07:17.160
Are you sure?

07:17.260 --> 07:18.050
Young Master Guo is

07:18.050 --> 07:19.370
one of our regulars here.

07:19.370 --> 07:20.700
I've never seen him

07:20.700 --> 07:21.590
take a servant with him.

07:21.610 --> 07:24.200
Did Wan'er make a mistake?

07:24.420 --> 07:25.540
I wonder Young Master Fan

07:25.540 --> 07:26.700
who beat him

07:26.700 --> 07:27.910
would admit his crime or not.

07:27.930 --> 07:28.610
What are you saying?

07:28.610 --> 07:30.750
Who did it?

07:30.770 --> 07:33.090
Boss. Boss.

07:33.370 --> 07:34.690
The case is closed.

07:34.740 --> 07:35.860
What crime has the Imperial Magistrate

07:35.860 --> 07:37.750
sentenced against Young Master Fan Xian?

07:37.770 --> 07:38.870
He is not guilty.

07:38.890 --> 07:40.580
Si Lili from the Joy Tsin House

07:40.580 --> 07:41.800
testified for him on the court.

07:41.820 --> 07:43.330
She said that Young Master Fan

07:43.330 --> 07:44.680
slept at the Joy Tsin House that night.

07:44.700 --> 07:45.610
So he couldn't

07:45.610 --> 07:47.090
beat Guo Baokun.

07:47.820 --> 07:49.370
Say that again!

07:57.420 --> 07:58.760
Hey, kid.

07:59.140 --> 08:00.440
Could I ask you something?

08:00.860 --> 08:03.160
Is there a village not far away?

08:05.740 --> 08:06.680
I've been here once at night,

08:06.700 --> 08:07.700
but I almost forget it.

08:07.700 --> 08:08.970
Thank you.

08:18.260 --> 08:19.530
So delicious.

08:20.610 --> 08:21.680
Kid.

08:21.700 --> 08:23.370
Gimme your candied haws. Let me check it out.

08:31.580 --> 08:32.760
Give it back!

08:32.780 --> 08:33.830
Give it back!

08:33.850 --> 08:34.410
Give it back!

08:34.410 --> 08:35.340
It was mixed with little poison,

08:35.340 --> 08:37.010
so he will only suffer from diarrhea.

08:39.100 --> 08:40.370
Wait.

08:40.730 --> 08:41.510
Tell me

08:41.530 --> 08:43.080
who gave you this string of candied haws?

08:43.900 --> 08:45.770
Don't look at me that way.

08:46.370 --> 08:48.050
How about this? I give you the money.

08:48.050 --> 08:49.720
And you give me this string of candied haws, okay?

08:55.020 --> 08:57.080
Anyway, it tastes good.

09:05.460 --> 09:07.150
You didn't go back?

09:07.170 --> 09:09.160
I ask Fan Sizhe to go back.

09:10.410 --> 09:11.600
Sit.

09:13.340 --> 09:14.810
You make it for your son?

09:15.700 --> 09:16.560
Boys

09:16.580 --> 09:17.910
like this kind of stuffs.

09:17.930 --> 09:20.010
Good. It's so delicate.

09:20.260 --> 09:21.770
He has never seen me before

09:21.930 --> 09:23.650
let alone call me dad.

09:24.530 --> 09:25.170
Maybe it is because

09:25.170 --> 09:26.890
you were not home for years.

09:27.530 --> 09:28.840
I owe him.

09:29.900 --> 09:31.400
Things will be better.

09:31.610 --> 09:33.600
And you don't need to hide in the future.

09:33.660 --> 09:35.280
Even His Majesty knows you are still alive.

09:35.580 --> 09:37.350
Did you say you want to leave the capital city?

09:37.370 --> 09:38.840
You can get prepared for it now.

09:41.140 --> 09:42.270
Where could I go?

09:42.290 --> 09:43.390
Just figure it out yourself.

09:43.410 --> 09:44.560
If you make the decision, just tell me.

09:44.580 --> 09:46.160
I will prepare a carriage for you.

09:46.530 --> 09:47.800
The capital city is not a safe place.

09:47.820 --> 09:49.510
It's good for you to leave here earlier.

09:49.530 --> 09:50.340
Or your families

09:50.340 --> 09:52.040
will always worry about you.

09:54.170 --> 09:55.480
What about you?

09:56.530 --> 09:58.760
My Lady Drumstick is in the capital city.

09:58.780 --> 10:00.650
I don't want to leave now.

10:01.850 --> 10:03.100
Well, you haven't told me

10:03.100 --> 10:04.600
why you asked me here?

10:06.020 --> 10:08.130
You haven't met my families, have you?

10:09.700 --> 10:10.800
I came here in a rush

10:10.820 --> 10:12.270
and didn't prepare any gifts for them.

10:12.290 --> 10:13.570
No need.

10:14.660 --> 10:16.010
Honey.

10:16.900 --> 10:18.450
Fan Xian is here.

10:20.610 --> 10:22.370
Greetings to you, Your Excellency.

10:22.660 --> 10:23.950
Please don't be so polite.

10:23.970 --> 10:24.800
According to the seniority,

10:24.820 --> 10:26.080
I should call you sister-in-law.

10:26.100 --> 10:27.560
You have a noble identity.

10:27.580 --> 10:28.950
I don't dare to accept that.

10:28.970 --> 10:29.780
At the gate of the Investigator's Office,

10:29.780 --> 10:30.830
there is a stele,

10:30.850 --> 10:32.510
inscribing that men are created equal

10:32.530 --> 10:33.810
and there is neither lowliness nor nobleness.

10:35.660 --> 10:36.960
Where is our son?

10:37.170 --> 10:38.600
He came back just now.

10:39.970 --> 10:41.590
Come here. we have a guest.

10:41.610 --> 10:42.920
Say hello to our guest.

10:42.970 --> 10:44.280
Sword.

10:44.930 --> 10:46.840
I made it for you. Do you like it?

10:46.930 --> 10:48.250
Yes, I do.

10:50.660 --> 10:51.910
Alright. Don't play the sword.

10:51.930 --> 10:53.810
Come here. Call him uncle.

10:56.220 --> 10:57.930
This uncle is so weird.

10:57.930 --> 11:00.160
He took my candied haws.

11:44.700 --> 11:47.400
Your Majesty. Mei Zhili has arrived.

11:47.580 --> 11:48.840
Bring him here.

11:54.930 --> 11:55.760
Your Majesty.

11:55.780 --> 11:56.580
Sit.

11:56.600 --> 11:57.800
=Mei Zhili, Imperial Magistrate of Prefecture of Capital City=

11:57.820 --> 12:00.120
I don't dare. I am terrified.

12:00.140 --> 12:02.130
Obedience is better than politeness.

12:02.220 --> 12:03.690
Sit.

12:04.730 --> 12:05.590
Well.

12:05.610 --> 12:07.510
This is not the front hall.

12:07.530 --> 12:10.370
I ask you to have a seat. Then just sit down.

12:10.780 --> 12:12.370
Gratitude, Your Majesty.

12:16.050 --> 12:18.160
You like drinking mud honey?

12:19.610 --> 12:20.850
Your Majesty, you are so kind to me.

12:20.850 --> 12:23.600
I feel so grateful.

12:30.020 --> 12:32.390
Today let's ignore who we are.

12:32.410 --> 12:34.400
We are just friends.

12:38.460 --> 12:40.160
Have a seat.

12:44.460 --> 12:47.130
I still remember the time when we first met,

12:47.820 --> 12:50.130
especially when I was the crown price.

12:51.610 --> 12:56.320
You also have greying temples.

12:56.340 --> 12:59.770
One year ends and another begins. Nobody could avoid it.

12:59.850 --> 13:02.830
You have been working so hard. Thank you.

13:02.850 --> 13:05.240
Your Majesty, it's my job.

13:05.260 --> 13:08.710
That year, I was not in an important position.

13:08.730 --> 13:11.240
If not Your Majesty trusted me,

13:11.260 --> 13:13.080
I won't make it today.

13:13.100 --> 13:15.080
Do you still remember it?

13:17.530 --> 13:18.960
I remember it.

13:19.490 --> 13:22.400
When Your Majesty ascended the throne,

13:22.530 --> 13:24.850
people all said the Imperial Magistrate

13:24.850 --> 13:26.510
took charge of all affairs in the capital city.

13:26.530 --> 13:29.570
And the position is always taken by
offsprings of the royal family.

13:29.780 --> 13:33.330
If you didn't hold your own opinion against the others

13:33.490 --> 13:35.030
and ordered me to

13:35.050 --> 13:37.690
take such an important position,

13:38.170 --> 13:40.520
if I don't make painstaking efforts,

13:40.580 --> 13:43.530
I will feel sorry for your trust.

13:43.530 --> 13:46.590
These years,

13:46.610 --> 13:49.150
I have been always driven by it to do my job.

13:49.170 --> 13:51.080
It keeps me on my toes.

13:51.700 --> 13:54.840
Many memories arise as if it were yesterday.

13:56.290 --> 13:58.080
I always think about that

13:59.140 --> 14:00.770
since we have such a connection,

14:01.260 --> 14:04.210
we should have a good ending.

14:05.850 --> 14:07.720
What a pity!

14:08.660 --> 14:12.690
We always get the opposite of what we want.

14:12.900 --> 14:15.720
Your Majesty. I confess.

14:17.140 --> 14:18.240
We're just chatting.

14:18.260 --> 14:20.000
Why do you confess?

14:20.020 --> 14:21.220
What do you confess for?

14:21.220 --> 14:22.450
I...

14:22.970 --> 14:25.240
I shouldn't interrogate Fan Xian.

14:25.260 --> 14:26.270
You received the written complaint.

14:26.290 --> 14:27.820
As the Imperial Magistrate,

14:27.820 --> 14:29.650
you should do your job.

14:30.170 --> 14:32.270
When the Crown Prince visited the court,

14:32.290 --> 14:36.470
I disobeyed the criminal law and got confused.

14:36.490 --> 14:38.150
The Crown Prince visited the court.

14:38.170 --> 14:43.280
You didn't know how to deal with it. I understand.

14:44.410 --> 14:47.010
When you took the position that year,

14:47.460 --> 14:49.220
you wrote

14:49.220 --> 14:50.810
in your first memorial that

14:50.900 --> 14:53.920
the most important thing to be an official was

14:54.140 --> 14:55.390
loyalty.

14:55.410 --> 14:55.970
Your Majesty.

14:55.970 --> 14:59.140
I might be incompetent,

14:59.140 --> 15:01.320
but my loyalty to Your Majesty

15:01.340 --> 15:02.660
is so obvious that everyone could tell.

15:02.660 --> 15:04.210
Mei Zhili.

15:04.410 --> 15:07.030
I heard that you know

15:07.050 --> 15:09.800
how to predict fate through physiognomy.

15:09.820 --> 15:10.580
No.

15:10.580 --> 15:12.320
Come.

15:12.340 --> 15:13.610
Have a look at me.

15:13.610 --> 15:15.920
I... Well.

15:19.100 --> 15:20.450
I...

15:20.490 --> 15:24.910
Tell me if my time is up or not.

15:24.930 --> 15:26.470
Your Majesty, why do you say these words?

15:26.490 --> 15:28.330
If I die,

15:28.460 --> 15:31.590
you still have time to choose the Crown Prince.

15:31.610 --> 15:32.100
No.

15:32.100 --> 15:34.120
As a minister to three kings,

15:34.140 --> 15:37.200
you will get a good fame.

15:37.220 --> 15:38.650
Your Majesty.

15:39.050 --> 15:41.390
I've contributed my sincere heart to you.

15:41.410 --> 15:43.270
It never happened.

15:43.290 --> 15:45.010
Sincere heart?

15:46.290 --> 15:48.370
When the Crown Prince wanted to catch Teng Zijing,

15:48.410 --> 15:50.270
did you ask the Inspector

15:50.290 --> 15:51.710
to investigate his whereabouts?

15:51.730 --> 15:54.320
Did you order people to arrest him?

15:54.340 --> 15:55.590
If not,

15:55.610 --> 15:58.560
well, it's me who was convinced by the rumors.

15:58.580 --> 16:01.950
I should say sorry to you.

16:01.970 --> 16:03.030
Your Majesty.

16:03.050 --> 16:05.920
I confess. I am guilty.

16:06.100 --> 16:09.210
If you punish me by the law, I will never complain.

16:09.580 --> 16:11.470
You are a senior official,

16:11.490 --> 16:13.810
if I punish you by law,

16:14.050 --> 16:18.010
you may think I am cold-hearted.

16:21.410 --> 16:23.260
I understand.

16:23.260 --> 16:25.150
What do you understand?

16:25.170 --> 16:27.080
When I come back home today,

16:27.100 --> 16:30.680
I may probably fall into a well by accident.

16:30.700 --> 16:32.730
But my families

16:32.730 --> 16:34.030
know nothing about the case,

16:34.050 --> 16:38.450
I beg you to show some mercy.

16:45.900 --> 16:48.520
Alright.

16:50.290 --> 16:52.840
You haven't drunk the mud honey.

17:11.930 --> 17:13.080
Your...

17:30.010 --> 17:31.480
Don't be terrified.

17:31.740 --> 17:34.170
I will have a cup of mud honey with you.

17:45.620 --> 17:47.320
Mei Zhili.

17:48.700 --> 17:53.370
For old time's sake,

17:53.930 --> 17:55.840
don't jump into a well after you go back home.

17:56.460 --> 17:58.110
Write a memorial to apply for

17:58.130 --> 18:00.320
resigning from office and returning to your hometown.

18:00.500 --> 18:02.770
Don't get up too early tomorrow morning.

18:03.130 --> 18:06.370
I promise you can return to your hometown with honor

18:06.500 --> 18:09.480
and lead a peaceful life in the future.

18:10.500 --> 18:13.600
Thanks for your kindness, Your Majesty.

18:13.820 --> 18:16.510
It is now too late to repent.

18:16.530 --> 18:20.010
I wish you can keep healthy.

18:26.860 --> 18:29.560
Please take care of yourself.

19:04.820 --> 19:06.340
Ask the Investigator's Office

19:06.340 --> 19:08.440
to keep an eye on Mei Zhili,

19:09.170 --> 19:11.320
and kill him on his way to his hometown

19:13.130 --> 19:15.680
as a bandit.

19:17.250 --> 19:19.410
Yes, Your Majesty.

19:19.620 --> 19:21.170
In the hall today,

19:21.380 --> 19:23.250
what Fan Xian did has been known

19:23.290 --> 19:24.680
by all people in the capital city.

19:24.700 --> 19:26.080
I've heard about that.

19:27.410 --> 19:30.890
He wrote the line A thousand miles from home,
I'm grieved at autumn's plight;

19:31.100 --> 19:32.870
he beat someone on the street

19:32.890 --> 19:37.200
and a famous prostitute even suffers calamities because of him.

19:37.220 --> 19:39.680
It's extraordinarily bustling.

19:39.860 --> 19:42.650
Fan Xian is really good at poetizing.

19:42.740 --> 19:43.650
But he is

19:43.650 --> 19:45.440
too arrogant and rude.

19:45.460 --> 19:47.600
Now everyone knows that

19:47.620 --> 19:49.200
Fan Xian indulges in dallying with prostitutes

19:49.220 --> 19:50.910
and beat people on the street.

19:50.930 --> 19:53.250
If Wan'er marries him,

19:53.290 --> 19:54.680
I'm afraid that

19:55.770 --> 19:58.170
he will bring shame on the imperial family.

19:58.340 --> 20:01.530
Do you still want to turn down the marriage?

20:01.650 --> 20:03.110
He doesn't realize he is just a subject

20:03.130 --> 20:04.170
and doesn't show any respect

20:04.170 --> 20:05.910
to the Crown Prince in the court.

20:05.930 --> 20:07.320
If he takes over

20:07.340 --> 20:09.110
the Neiku in the future,

20:09.130 --> 20:11.080
I'm afraid there will hidden troubles.

20:15.380 --> 20:19.680
I am tired. You should leave now.

20:37.340 --> 20:40.990
She never wants

20:41.010 --> 20:43.720
to marry Wan'er to Fan Xian.

20:44.530 --> 20:45.910
But what she said

20:45.930 --> 20:47.720
makes sense.

20:47.890 --> 20:49.530
Fan Xian's reputation

20:49.530 --> 20:52.230
is really not that good.

20:52.250 --> 20:54.370
I'm afraid

20:54.820 --> 20:57.320
the marriage is improper.

20:57.650 --> 20:59.770
Your Majesty could issue a decree

21:00.220 --> 21:02.800
to break off the engagement.

21:06.700 --> 21:10.800
I will leave it to the emperor.

21:14.250 --> 21:15.500
How dare you

21:15.500 --> 21:17.370
ask High Highness about the assassination

21:17.930 --> 21:20.390
in front of so many people?

21:20.410 --> 21:23.010
I wanted to know it, then I asked.

21:23.380 --> 21:24.560
But he said nothing.

21:24.580 --> 21:25.220
As for the girl named Si Lili

21:25.220 --> 21:27.110
who has suffered the cruel torture for you,

21:27.130 --> 21:29.290
everyone is gossiping about

21:29.290 --> 21:31.320
your personal relationship now.

21:31.650 --> 21:32.930
She suffered the cruel torture

21:32.930 --> 21:34.410
not for me.

21:35.530 --> 21:37.500
Miss. A few young men

21:37.500 --> 21:39.910
have been attracted here by your reputation.

21:39.930 --> 21:41.700
They are waiting outside

21:41.700 --> 21:44.290
and want to appreciate your graceful bearing.

21:49.890 --> 21:52.150
By virtue of the cruel torture,

21:52.170 --> 21:54.370
I won the reputation.

21:55.740 --> 21:57.560
From today on,

21:57.650 --> 21:58.820
I have settled down

21:58.820 --> 22:00.530
in the capital city.

22:02.010 --> 22:03.840
It's

22:04.770 --> 22:06.600
worth it.

22:10.860 --> 22:12.170
You wanted to punish Guo Baokun.

22:12.170 --> 22:13.170
Fine, it's okay.

22:13.170 --> 22:15.530
But you leaked your whereabouts

22:15.620 --> 22:16.820
and even asked the girl from the Joy Tsin House

22:16.820 --> 22:19.010
to be your witness in advance.

22:19.340 --> 22:21.270
You've done all these things

22:21.290 --> 22:23.750
because you want to tell all people that

22:23.770 --> 22:25.800
you are lust for women and arrogant.

22:25.820 --> 22:26.870
You're right.

22:26.890 --> 22:27.600
Why?

22:27.620 --> 22:28.360
I want to break off the engagement.

22:28.380 --> 22:30.170
You don't want to marry Lin Wan'er?

22:30.170 --> 22:31.750
I've told you about the Lady Drumstick.

22:31.770 --> 22:32.530
If only you marry Lin Wan'er,

22:32.530 --> 22:33.990
you could take the Neiku back.

22:34.010 --> 22:35.100
It's not easy to meet a girl I like.

22:35.100 --> 22:36.100
Neiku is

22:36.100 --> 22:37.720
your mother's property.

22:37.740 --> 22:38.890
I think

22:39.580 --> 22:41.890
she would prefer to see me living a happy life.

22:52.410 --> 22:54.630
Did you say you want to leave the capital city?

22:54.650 --> 22:55.910
You can get prepared for it now.

22:55.930 --> 22:57.440
Where could I go for?

22:57.500 --> 22:58.720
Just figure it out yourself.

22:58.740 --> 23:00.030
If you make the decision, just tell me.

23:00.050 --> 23:01.770
I will prepare a carriage for you.

23:01.890 --> 23:02.870
The capital city is not a safe place.

23:02.890 --> 23:04.680
It's good for you to leave here earlier.

23:04.820 --> 23:05.890
Or your families

23:05.890 --> 23:07.890
will always worry about you.

23:20.220 --> 23:21.930
Have you packed our luggage up?

23:23.220 --> 23:25.080
We will leave here tomorrow.

23:25.380 --> 23:26.840
Where are we going?

23:26.980 --> 23:28.440
In such a big world,

23:29.050 --> 23:31.050
we can go everywhere.

23:31.530 --> 23:33.250
It's better than staying in the capital city.

23:34.130 --> 23:35.770
It's been so many years.

23:36.500 --> 23:38.370
I have always wanted to leave

23:38.740 --> 23:40.410
and kept thinking about it.

23:41.290 --> 23:43.200
Till now,

23:45.130 --> 23:47.080
my wish is fulfilled.

23:48.740 --> 23:53.720
But it seems like you are not happy.

23:59.980 --> 24:01.560
Go.

24:03.930 --> 24:05.720
To where?

24:06.860 --> 24:08.600
To meet him.

24:09.500 --> 24:11.650
No matter what decision you will make,

24:11.860 --> 24:13.960
we will always be with you.

24:19.340 --> 24:21.800
Ling'er, you can't cheat me.

24:21.820 --> 24:23.230
It's absolutely true.

24:23.250 --> 24:25.800
Guo Baokun has no servant.

24:29.100 --> 24:30.750
How could it be like this?

24:30.770 --> 24:33.200
You are still in the mood of caring about his servant.

24:33.220 --> 24:34.530
Do you know

24:34.530 --> 24:36.680
how people gossip Fan Xian now?

24:36.700 --> 24:39.270
Last time he hid a girl singer in the carriage

24:39.290 --> 24:40.460
and this time he was in a tangle with Si Lili

24:40.460 --> 24:42.110
from the Joy Tsin House.

24:42.130 --> 24:43.410
You are a princess,

24:43.410 --> 24:45.890
how can you marry such a disgraceful man?

24:54.700 --> 24:56.250
Please rest assured.

24:56.340 --> 24:58.770
I will help you to break off the engagement.

24:59.740 --> 25:01.150
It's getting late.

25:01.170 --> 25:02.510
You'd better go to bed now.

25:02.530 --> 25:04.170
I will see you tomorrow.

25:18.620 --> 25:20.800
If you are not the servant,

25:21.820 --> 25:23.890
who else are you?

25:24.980 --> 25:26.680
I heard that Wan'er came here

25:26.980 --> 25:28.650
and wanted to break off the engagement.

25:29.010 --> 25:30.220
But Fan Xian has bad manners.

25:30.220 --> 25:32.050
She hasn't seen him.

25:33.460 --> 25:35.030
I think

25:35.050 --> 25:38.010
she must hate to marry with him.

25:38.250 --> 25:39.050
But Her Majesty

25:39.050 --> 25:40.770
hasn't agreed her with that yet.

25:41.530 --> 25:43.320
They just care about the state affairs.

25:43.460 --> 25:45.770
Nobody cares about what's on Wan'er's mind.

25:45.820 --> 25:47.320
Her Highness ordered us not to gossip.

25:53.930 --> 25:57.290
You'd better go out of the palace

25:57.460 --> 25:58.870
and pass on a message for me.

25:58.890 --> 26:00.200
Break off the engagement?

26:00.220 --> 26:01.230
Yes.

26:01.250 --> 26:02.680
Her Highness said

26:02.820 --> 26:03.620
this marriage

26:03.620 --> 26:05.290
is not what she wishes.

26:05.290 --> 26:06.740
Now she knows Fan Xian is so ridiculous,

26:06.740 --> 26:08.290
she hates him much more.

26:08.340 --> 26:08.860
Although His Majesty and Her Majesty

26:08.860 --> 26:09.990
haven't agreed her with that,

26:10.010 --> 26:12.390
Her Highness will manage to find a way out

26:12.410 --> 26:13.960
and asks you not to worry about it.

26:13.980 --> 26:15.410
Her Highness will help you to break off the engagement

26:15.410 --> 26:17.720
and never marry you to a man you don't like.

26:19.860 --> 26:21.770
Then I should thank him to his face.

26:22.530 --> 26:23.840
Her Highness said

26:23.860 --> 26:25.410
you should recuperate at home.

26:25.410 --> 26:26.800
You don't need to visit her.

26:27.340 --> 26:30.170
Please send my regards to mother.

26:30.820 --> 26:32.230
I will.

26:32.250 --> 26:34.960
What's more, Her Highness asked

26:35.170 --> 26:37.320
if you have anyone in mind?

26:37.460 --> 26:39.080
No, I...

26:39.100 --> 26:41.370
I don't have anyone in mind.

26:41.740 --> 26:43.530
Then I will reply Her Highness as you said.

26:43.530 --> 26:44.650
Well.

26:45.500 --> 26:50.600
Well, if we break off the engagement,

26:51.340 --> 26:55.200
can I marry anyone I like regardless of his status?

26:55.740 --> 26:56.980
Her Highness said that

26:56.980 --> 26:58.700
if you really like him,

26:58.700 --> 27:00.320
it doesn't matter who he is.

27:03.340 --> 27:07.500
Well, what if he is just a servant?

27:07.500 --> 27:09.370
That's okay.

27:09.410 --> 27:10.840
A servant?

27:11.650 --> 27:12.840
I am just off the top of my head.

27:12.860 --> 27:14.200
I don't mean anybody.

27:18.820 --> 27:20.290
A servant?

27:21.050 --> 27:22.390
Whose servant is he?

27:22.410 --> 27:24.050
It's weird.

27:24.100 --> 27:26.100
Her Highness has been recuperating at home for years,

27:26.100 --> 27:27.320
she has few chances to make friends.

27:27.340 --> 27:28.500
Even if she has some friends,

27:28.500 --> 27:29.840
they are all girls.

27:29.860 --> 27:30.620
It's impossible for her

27:30.620 --> 27:32.560
to encounter some servant.

27:33.530 --> 27:34.930
Go check it out

27:35.460 --> 27:37.630
whose servant

27:37.650 --> 27:39.010
has met Her Highness.

27:39.290 --> 27:40.600
And then

27:42.500 --> 27:44.360
check out which kind of people he is and his background.

27:44.380 --> 27:46.030
Then we can talk about the other things.

27:46.050 --> 27:47.320
I will.

28:00.740 --> 28:02.290
Uncle Wuzhu.

28:02.770 --> 28:03.380
Are you really completely

28:03.380 --> 28:05.130
disappeared from then on?

28:06.930 --> 28:08.800
So many things have happened recently.

28:09.620 --> 28:11.320
When I have to make a choice,

28:11.530 --> 28:13.770
I don't know whether it's right or wrong.

28:14.010 --> 28:15.440
If you were me,

28:16.530 --> 28:18.440
what will you choose to do?

28:26.770 --> 28:28.750
It's so late. Why are you here?

28:28.770 --> 28:29.410
Why did you

28:29.410 --> 28:31.010
take my son's candied haws away?

28:32.220 --> 28:34.150
I have explained it to you.

28:34.170 --> 28:36.100
I took it away

28:36.100 --> 28:36.980
because I knew

28:36.980 --> 28:37.700
he was poisoned.

28:37.700 --> 28:39.360
I did it for your son's sake.

28:39.380 --> 28:40.410
But you bit it.

28:40.410 --> 28:41.890
Because I wanted to check it out.

28:41.890 --> 28:43.360
I think you are a fool.

28:43.380 --> 28:45.560
Do you have to taste it for that?

28:45.930 --> 28:47.650
What if you die because of it?

28:48.410 --> 28:49.620
I won't die because of that.

28:49.620 --> 28:51.770
I'm Fei Jie's student.

28:52.500 --> 28:53.720
You were so stupid that

28:54.460 --> 28:55.800
you even

28:55.820 --> 28:57.680
questioned His Highness on the court.

28:58.220 --> 28:59.870
I just wanted to know the truth.

28:59.890 --> 29:01.250
What can you do if you know it?

29:02.650 --> 29:03.500
I haven't figured it out yet.

29:03.500 --> 29:04.700
So I think you are a fool.

29:04.700 --> 29:05.340
Do you think

29:05.340 --> 29:06.410
you are under the cover of the Second Prince

29:06.410 --> 29:07.840
and the Crown Prince doesn't dare to hurt you?

29:07.860 --> 29:09.200
I am not on the Second Prince's side.

29:09.220 --> 29:10.680
Then you can't be more stupid.

29:10.700 --> 29:11.770
You don't even have a shelter.

29:11.770 --> 29:13.370
Why are you so arrogant?

29:17.290 --> 29:18.650
Bro.

29:19.130 --> 29:20.700
You come to my house so late

29:20.700 --> 29:22.890
just for scolding me?

29:31.580 --> 29:33.370
I

29:34.010 --> 29:35.030
will stay.

29:35.050 --> 29:38.010
What? You won't leave the capital city?

29:38.010 --> 29:39.630
You are so stupid. If I leave here,

29:39.650 --> 29:40.620
I'm afraid you can't survive

29:40.620 --> 29:41.680
by yourself.

29:41.700 --> 29:42.930
You always say that

29:42.930 --> 29:45.030
you want to leave the capital city, don't you?

29:45.050 --> 29:45.960
Fifty taels.

29:45.980 --> 29:46.720
What?

29:46.740 --> 29:47.340
You give me fifty taels of silver

29:47.340 --> 29:48.560
every month.

29:48.580 --> 29:49.960
No arrears.

29:50.290 --> 29:51.870
My son is at the school age.

29:51.890 --> 29:53.100
You should find him the best teacher

29:53.100 --> 29:54.910
through your relationship with the Fan family.

29:54.930 --> 29:56.080
Moreover,

29:56.100 --> 29:57.510
you should give me

29:57.530 --> 29:59.010
two acres of fertilized land

29:59.220 --> 30:01.170
and an ox.

30:04.380 --> 30:06.130
In the following days,

30:07.220 --> 30:09.390
the Crown Prince may attack me at any time.

30:09.410 --> 30:10.750
Because of your stupid behavior.

30:10.770 --> 30:11.460
You stay here at the time

30:11.460 --> 30:12.840
to be my guard.

30:12.860 --> 30:15.680
Silver, land and ox.

30:16.010 --> 30:17.230
I want all of them.

30:17.250 --> 30:18.440
Have you made up your mind?

30:18.460 --> 30:19.650
The capital city is not a safe place.

30:19.650 --> 30:21.050
No bargaining.

30:26.220 --> 30:28.650
Fine. Deal.

30:41.530 --> 30:44.250
What are you doing? Get up.

30:51.770 --> 30:53.010
By the way,

30:54.740 --> 30:56.220
do you know

30:56.220 --> 30:57.600
who poisoned your son?

30:58.530 --> 30:59.510
It's me.

30:59.530 --> 31:00.510
You?

31:00.530 --> 31:01.680
Yeah.

31:01.700 --> 31:02.460
He likes candies.

31:02.460 --> 31:03.720
I'm afraid his teeth will decay,

31:03.740 --> 31:04.840
so I poison him.

31:04.860 --> 31:05.910
If he eats too many candies,

31:05.930 --> 31:06.990
he will suffer from stomachache.

31:07.010 --> 31:08.360
Then I can control the intake.

31:08.380 --> 31:09.860
You even poison your own son

31:09.860 --> 31:11.460
because of this?

31:11.460 --> 31:13.320
I can't scare him with a knife.

31:13.340 --> 31:15.480
How can you behave like this as a dad?

31:15.700 --> 31:17.440
I am a new dad.

31:17.460 --> 31:18.680
I have to learn how to be a dad.

31:18.700 --> 31:19.720
Your son is so tough.

31:19.740 --> 31:21.030
My son is happy.

31:21.050 --> 31:22.870
He likes the wooden knife I made for him.

31:22.890 --> 31:24.050
I still want to make him

31:24.050 --> 31:26.270
a wooden sword, a wooden bow and a wooden dart.

31:26.290 --> 31:27.630
Please tell me

31:27.650 --> 31:28.870
which one I should make first.

31:28.890 --> 31:30.050
Can you make him

31:30.050 --> 31:31.360
a wooden horse?

31:31.380 --> 31:32.910
Then I will make him a wooden lance.

31:32.930 --> 31:34.270
He is not a cavalry.

31:34.290 --> 31:35.740
He is just a kid.

31:35.740 --> 31:37.170
Just make him a wooden horse for kids.

31:38.170 --> 31:39.460
Why do you always give people

31:39.460 --> 31:40.910
such an ill feeling?

31:40.930 --> 31:41.820
If you want to get along with kids,

31:41.820 --> 31:42.750
the most important thing is

31:42.770 --> 31:43.820
to keep the childlike innocence

31:43.820 --> 31:44.860
and behave in a naive way.

31:44.860 --> 31:45.460
Then you can

31:45.460 --> 31:46.290
get close to him.

31:46.290 --> 31:46.980
Do you understand?

31:46.980 --> 31:47.860
Then why did you

31:47.860 --> 31:49.800
take my son's candied haws away?

31:50.050 --> 31:52.290
I said I didn't do that.

31:52.580 --> 31:53.560
But you bit it.

31:53.580 --> 31:54.960
I wanted to check out whether it was poisoned or not.

31:55.460 --> 31:57.250
I think you are stupid.

31:57.530 --> 31:58.630
I will not die because of that.

31:58.650 --> 32:00.130
You are really stupid.

32:01.100 --> 32:02.840
Fine. I am stupid.

32:30.050 --> 32:31.270
Your Majesty.

32:31.290 --> 32:33.110
Her Majesty sent people here

32:33.130 --> 32:35.440
to ask you to go to sleep early.

32:36.410 --> 32:37.800
What else did Her Majesty say?

32:38.930 --> 32:41.510
She said Fan Xian

32:41.530 --> 32:43.720
disrespected the Crown Prince on the court.

32:43.770 --> 32:44.930
She didn't say it in a direct way,

32:44.930 --> 32:47.050
but I'm afraid, Your Majesty,

32:47.050 --> 32:49.750
that you should think over the marriage of Her Highness.

32:49.770 --> 32:51.680
After all, it's an imperial marriage,

32:51.700 --> 32:53.440
Your Majesty, you should be cautious.

32:53.460 --> 32:55.410
If he showed respects to the Crown Prince,

32:55.410 --> 32:56.500
he would be

32:56.500 --> 32:58.010
the same as Mei Zhili.

32:59.770 --> 33:01.130
Tell me, how close he has got

33:01.130 --> 33:03.050
to the Second Prince?

33:03.130 --> 33:04.370
The Second Prince

33:04.500 --> 33:06.680
showed up on the court today,

33:06.820 --> 33:10.010
but I still think His Highness went there on purpose.

33:11.700 --> 33:12.840
In this way,

33:12.860 --> 33:15.800
the Crown Prince may think that

33:15.820 --> 33:18.080
Fan Xian has been on the side of the Second Prince.

33:18.100 --> 33:19.650
In such a hurry and confusion,

33:19.650 --> 33:20.960
the Crown Prince may take action.

33:20.980 --> 33:23.770
At that time, he will be caught tripping

33:23.770 --> 33:25.800
by the Second Prince.

33:25.860 --> 33:27.560
My sons

33:27.930 --> 33:30.010
are really hard to deal with.

33:30.050 --> 33:32.270
His Highnesses are detail-minded.

33:32.290 --> 33:34.560
They are the best of the best.

33:35.340 --> 33:38.370
Do you think they can cheat on each other?

33:39.700 --> 33:41.560
I don't dare to tell.

33:41.580 --> 33:43.010
It's not finished yet.

33:43.580 --> 33:47.080
Sit on our hands. Let them play.

33:51.930 --> 33:52.840
Eunuch Hou.

33:52.860 --> 33:53.940
I'm here.

33:54.980 --> 33:56.340
You have

33:56.340 --> 33:58.320
talked too much recently.

34:19.580 --> 34:20.380
It's so early.

34:20.380 --> 34:21.920
What's the rush?

34:21.940 --> 34:23.080
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

34:23.100 --> 34:24.600
I have been waiting here early in the morning

34:24.620 --> 34:26.240
for fear of bothering you.

34:26.530 --> 34:28.490
Her Highness asked me to tell you that

34:28.490 --> 34:31.520
His Excellency Mei asked for reassignment
because of illness yesterday.

34:31.660 --> 34:32.900
On his way to the hometown,

34:32.900 --> 34:34.730
he has been murdered as a bandit.

34:34.940 --> 34:37.560
Her Highness thinks that

34:38.660 --> 34:40.210
it must be His Majesty's order...

34:42.860 --> 34:44.490
It's my fault.

34:44.660 --> 34:45.730
I was in such a rush to declare Fan Xian's guilty

34:45.730 --> 34:47.650
but got Mei Zhili involved in it.

34:48.490 --> 34:50.360
Her Highness also said that

34:50.380 --> 34:51.450
Fan Xian may have been

34:51.450 --> 34:53.230
on the side of the Second Prince.

34:53.250 --> 34:54.840
Before long,

34:54.860 --> 34:55.900
he would be a throne in your flesh

34:55.900 --> 34:57.370
for Your Highness.

34:58.340 --> 35:00.170
I don't think so.

35:00.420 --> 35:01.890
I know him well.

35:02.140 --> 35:04.030
If Fan Xian is on his side,

35:04.050 --> 35:05.750
he would not show up himself.

35:05.770 --> 35:07.320
If he has to show up himself,

35:07.380 --> 35:08.990
it proves that Fan Xian

35:09.010 --> 35:10.970
isn't on his side.

35:11.380 --> 35:12.670
Her Highness thought

35:12.690 --> 35:14.190
even so,

35:14.210 --> 35:15.840
you can't just let Fan Xian

35:15.860 --> 35:17.800
take over the property ownership.

35:21.250 --> 35:22.800
Go back and tell Auntie that

35:22.820 --> 35:24.270
for the time being,

35:24.290 --> 35:25.990
His Majesty transferred Fan Xian to the post,

35:26.010 --> 35:27.840
I'm afraid he must take him as the bait,

35:28.050 --> 35:29.920
if you want to attack Fan Xian again,

35:29.940 --> 35:31.760
you must kill him with one shot

35:31.940 --> 35:34.040
and never get the official force involved.

35:36.940 --> 35:38.650
We can't take actions in such a hurry.

35:39.210 --> 35:40.760
Let me think it over.

36:05.210 --> 36:06.970
Why are you here again?

36:09.050 --> 36:10.920
Fan Xian told me that you are going to leave.

36:10.940 --> 36:12.270
I have made a deal with him

36:12.290 --> 36:13.560
and then I come back.

36:13.580 --> 36:14.890
Where is he?

36:17.180 --> 36:18.760
He is with my dad?

36:20.380 --> 36:22.080
What happened in the early morning?

36:22.100 --> 36:23.890
I don't know.

36:24.210 --> 36:26.040
Fine.

36:31.530 --> 36:33.000
I have a question.

36:34.580 --> 36:36.560
How much money

36:37.420 --> 36:39.080
does Fan Xian pay you every month?

36:41.340 --> 36:42.430
What are you saying?

36:42.450 --> 36:44.210
Haven't I made it clear enough?

36:44.210 --> 36:45.510
No. I've heard what you are saying

36:45.530 --> 36:46.580
but I can't understand.

36:46.580 --> 36:47.690
What do you mean by Lin Wan'er and I

36:47.690 --> 36:48.600
are still engaged!

36:48.620 --> 36:49.840
I mean

36:49.860 --> 36:51.420
you will marry her.

36:51.420 --> 36:52.820
Well. I have messed it up like that.

36:52.820 --> 36:54.120
Why didn't they break off the engagement?

36:54.140 --> 36:57.080
It's said that the imperial harem is not satisfied with you

36:57.100 --> 36:59.320
and even Her Majesty dislikes you.

36:59.340 --> 37:00.450
That's what I want.

37:00.450 --> 37:01.660
But why didn't they cancel the engagement?

37:01.660 --> 37:03.080
His Majesty ordered that

37:03.100 --> 37:04.600
you are still going to get married.

37:05.620 --> 37:06.490
Well, I...

37:06.490 --> 37:07.880
Let me figure out the relations.

37:07.900 --> 37:10.120
The Princess Royal is His Majesty's younger sister.

37:10.140 --> 37:12.750
Lin Wan'er is the Princess Royal's daughter.

37:12.770 --> 37:15.710
Lin Wan'er has no blood relation with
His Majesty, but she is a princess.

37:15.730 --> 37:16.800
That is to say,

37:16.820 --> 37:17.940
His Majesty is

37:17.940 --> 37:18.620
Lin Wan'er's uncle.

37:18.620 --> 37:19.340
You're right.

37:19.340 --> 37:20.270
Father.

37:20.290 --> 37:21.320
There is nobody else here.

37:21.340 --> 37:22.510
Please tell me the truth.

37:22.530 --> 37:23.320
About what?

37:23.340 --> 37:24.100
Tell me whether

37:24.100 --> 37:25.320
His Majesty is out of mind or not.

37:25.340 --> 37:26.050
How dare you!

37:26.050 --> 37:27.080
I have a bad reputation now,

37:27.100 --> 37:27.970
why does he force

37:27.970 --> 37:28.940
his sister's daughter

37:28.940 --> 37:30.210
to marry me?

37:30.530 --> 37:34.950
His Majesty must have his own intentions.

37:34.970 --> 37:36.840
Then what about My Lady Drumstick?

37:38.490 --> 37:39.930
Just forget her.

37:53.380 --> 37:55.490
He really will pay you 50 taels?

37:57.340 --> 37:58.650
Fan Xian.

37:58.730 --> 37:59.490
You pay him 50 taels

37:59.490 --> 38:00.770
every month.

38:00.770 --> 38:01.840
Why do you ask about this?

38:01.860 --> 38:03.340
You even bought him

38:03.340 --> 38:05.130
land and ox.

38:05.210 --> 38:05.860
I don't even

38:05.860 --> 38:07.160
get 50 taels per month.

38:07.180 --> 38:08.010
Well brother,

38:08.010 --> 38:09.670
how about this?

38:09.690 --> 38:10.970
I will exchange my identity with him.

38:10.970 --> 38:12.100
I want to be your guard.

38:12.100 --> 38:13.140
Cut the crap!

38:13.140 --> 38:14.190
I'm looking for you.

38:14.210 --> 38:14.820
Take Ruoruo along.

38:14.820 --> 38:15.750
You will go out with me.

38:15.770 --> 38:16.430
What are you going to do?

38:16.450 --> 38:17.690
Take my wife back.

38:20.250 --> 38:20.860
If you pay me 50 taels,

38:20.860 --> 38:22.600
I will think about it.

38:29.450 --> 38:30.420
Sister.

38:30.420 --> 38:31.730
You go out with me

38:31.730 --> 38:33.080
without asking where we are going?

38:33.100 --> 38:34.120
Why should I?

38:34.140 --> 38:36.100
We should know what we are going to do, shouldn't we?

38:36.100 --> 38:37.560
Brother has his plan.

38:38.620 --> 38:39.490
If he plans to sell you,

38:39.490 --> 38:40.800
will you go with him?

38:40.820 --> 38:43.080
He must have his reasons if he does so.

38:43.180 --> 38:44.320
Fan Xian.

38:44.340 --> 38:45.420
What on earth

38:45.420 --> 38:47.100
have you done to my sister?

38:47.100 --> 38:47.820
My sister is

38:47.820 --> 38:49.270
the first talented girl in the capital city.

38:49.290 --> 38:50.050
Why does she behave like a silly girl

38:50.050 --> 38:51.690
in front of you?

38:51.900 --> 38:53.430
I should have told you what to do.

38:53.450 --> 38:55.730
Ruoruo. You are a girl.

38:55.940 --> 38:56.990
A little while later,

38:57.010 --> 38:58.750
when you see your sister-in-law, just take her away.

38:58.770 --> 39:00.080
Sister-in-law?

39:00.100 --> 39:01.530
If I marry My Lady Drumstick,

39:01.530 --> 39:02.970
then they won't force me to get married with Lin Wan'er.

39:02.970 --> 39:04.210
Brother, where are we going?

39:04.210 --> 39:05.450
Prince Jing's mansion.

39:05.860 --> 39:06.620
It's lucky that I know

39:06.620 --> 39:08.450
she is a servant girl of Prince Jing.

39:23.010 --> 39:25.710
Your Highness, Fan Xian asks to see you.

39:25.730 --> 39:26.670
Let him in.

39:26.690 --> 39:27.930
As you wish.

39:31.970 --> 39:33.370
Fan.

39:34.580 --> 39:36.340
Why are you here today?

39:36.340 --> 39:37.560
I want you to help me with one thing.

39:37.580 --> 39:38.670
What is it?

39:38.690 --> 39:40.600
I want to see the girls in your house.

39:42.180 --> 39:42.860
Which one?

39:42.860 --> 39:44.170
All of them.

39:47.660 --> 39:48.890
Well.

39:50.900 --> 39:52.270
Once I tell you whom she is,

39:52.290 --> 39:53.920
Ruoruo, you go and grab her.

39:53.940 --> 39:55.180
If I do it,

39:55.180 --> 39:56.600
I'm afraid it's a little rude.

39:57.580 --> 39:59.040
Please rest assured.

39:59.900 --> 40:02.000
You will never be ruder.

40:07.100 --> 40:10.520
Your Highness, I will get started.

40:16.100 --> 40:17.400
Come and line up.

40:17.420 --> 40:18.800
One by one.

40:18.820 --> 40:20.130
Come here.

40:23.690 --> 40:25.240
Do you want this one?

40:27.380 --> 40:28.600
This one?

40:29.490 --> 40:31.080
Next. Next.

40:32.530 --> 40:33.970
Next one.

40:36.490 --> 40:37.600
I think this girl is good, brother.

40:37.620 --> 40:38.050
Come one, next one.

40:38.050 --> 40:39.490
Next one.

40:46.730 --> 40:47.180
Come. You can go.

40:47.180 --> 40:48.800
Next one. Next one.

40:50.420 --> 40:51.970
Do you live here?

40:54.250 --> 40:55.970
Are you married?

40:56.690 --> 40:57.710
No.

40:57.730 --> 40:59.210
What's your name?

41:02.490 --> 41:04.490
Okay. Next one.

41:10.250 --> 41:12.490
Actually, this one is okay.

41:14.580 --> 41:16.280
It must be her.

41:18.100 --> 41:19.490
You haven't found her out?

41:23.900 --> 41:25.650
It's okay.

41:25.900 --> 41:27.080
Just wait.

41:28.010 --> 41:30.650
The next batch. Come on.

41:36.420 --> 41:38.130
You are really picky.

41:38.180 --> 41:38.900
Go. Go. Go.

41:38.900 --> 41:40.840
Don't be afraid. Go. Hurry.

41:41.380 --> 41:42.560
Is it her?

41:42.580 --> 41:43.100
Fine. It's not her.

41:43.100 --> 41:43.820
Go. Go. Go.

41:43.820 --> 41:44.970
My brother doesn't want to see you.

41:44.970 --> 41:46.320
Come.

41:47.050 --> 41:48.120
Haven't you found her?

41:48.140 --> 41:48.860
Don't worry.

41:48.860 --> 41:50.730
Brother, we still have another batch.

41:51.100 --> 41:53.320
The next batch. Come.

42:08.620 --> 42:10.470
They are all here?

42:10.490 --> 42:11.800
Yes.

42:15.140 --> 42:16.600
That's impossible.

42:16.860 --> 42:18.890
I saw her on the poetry gathering.

42:19.340 --> 42:20.950
That day,

42:20.970 --> 42:22.510
there were many guests.

42:22.530 --> 42:23.860
The maidservant you're looking for

42:23.860 --> 42:25.520
might not be from my mansion.

42:26.530 --> 42:28.000
If so,

42:28.490 --> 42:30.320
it won't be easy to find her.

42:30.450 --> 42:31.250
What if I visit all the families

42:31.250 --> 42:32.840
one by one?

42:35.250 --> 42:38.080
I'm afraid you'll probably be kicked out.

43:07.240 --> 43:10.820
In the river of history,

43:10.840 --> 43:14.310
time goes round and round.

43:17.120 --> 43:20.460
Memories about the former and present lives

43:20.480 --> 43:24.550
join each other in an endless way.

43:26.440 --> 43:29.060
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:29.080 --> 43:31.320
one season follows another in a flash,

43:31.320 --> 43:33.820
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:33.840 --> 43:35.440
I just can't give up

43:35.440 --> 43:38.780
to be with you for my whole life.

43:38.800 --> 43:44.270
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:45.520 --> 43:48.070
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:48.360 --> 43:50.400
Year after year in the wandering,

43:50.400 --> 43:53.060
I count the remaining years.

43:53.080 --> 43:55.260
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:55.280 --> 43:57.270
even though we have ended up the destiny,

43:57.560 --> 43:59.950
I never feel regretful.

44:00.000 --> 44:01.360
In such a chaotic world,

44:01.360 --> 44:04.340
I still miss you as ever.

44:04.360 --> 44:07.310
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:07.600 --> 44:09.660
With a gentle heart,

44:09.680 --> 44:12.340
I cherish our remaining years.

44:12.360 --> 44:13.880
Even though we have to go through

44:13.880 --> 44:16.390
all the hardships along the journey,

44:16.520 --> 44:23.710
you always stay by my side,

44:23.800 --> 44:26.470
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:26.760 --> 44:28.840
Year after year in the wandering,

44:28.840 --> 44:31.500
I count the remaining years.

44:31.520 --> 44:33.660
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:33.680 --> 44:35.910
even though we end up the destiny,

44:36.120 --> 44:38.300
I never feel regretful.

44:38.320 --> 44:39.720
In such a chaotic world,

44:39.720 --> 44:42.780
I still miss you as ever.

44:42.800 --> 44:45.910
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:46.000 --> 44:48.140
With a gentle heart,

44:48.160 --> 44:50.860
I cherish our remaining years.

44:50.880 --> 44:52.320
Even though we have to go through

44:52.320 --> 44:54.980
all the hardships along the journey,

44:55.000 --> 45:03.760
you always stay by my side...
